<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:08.000
Sonic!

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:17.090
Smoke!

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:19.800
Do something Tails!

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:21.470
Don't worry, Amy!

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:23.340
This first!

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:05.260
Hang on, Amy!

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:11.390
Rock!

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:13.190
Don't hit it!

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:14.730
Too late!

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:27.700
Knuckles!

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:31.000
Thank you!

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:34.500
Knuckles...

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:36.670
What's with him?

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.430
Hey, hey...you're going overboard...

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:54.520
Dr. Eggman, I closed all the walls nearby.

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:59.110
Darn! Why does that Sonic always get in my way…

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:06.490
Why else, Dr. Eggman! It's because you always keep doing bad things.

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:07.450
Chao!

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:09.800
Phooey! Too late already, anyway.

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:16.830
When I put this Last Chaos Emerald into this machine, my machine will have limitless power!

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:19.380
Don't!

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:20.750
Chao, chao, chao.

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:24.470
Right, Sonic would never allow for something like that!

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:28.720
All the walls have been closed!

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:34.600
It wouldn't be easy even for Sonic to...break it down.

00:05:34.890 --> 00:05:35.890
Sonic!

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:37.310
Chao!

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:40.940
Oh no...

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:43.480
However…

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:49.450
I guess you were a bit too late...

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:54.250
All I have to do now is to push this switch.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:59.210
So. All I have to do is to take it away from you first.

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:06.720
Why don't you give it a try then.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:10.390
Catch me!

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:11.890
Get him! Get him!

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:15.520
That's it! Fire, fire, fire!

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:21.400
Whaaa! No!

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:25.230
I'm pushing the switch!

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:29.070
What the...?! It's broken!

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:31.450
What the...?!

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:43.540
What is it?

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:48.220
Chaos Control.

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:08.300
Episode 1

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:08.300
Enter The Supersonic hedgehog!

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:22.830
Darn it. This is no time to be passing out.

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:28.630
What?!

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:53.490
Where am I?

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:58.620
And... those beings?

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:01.040
What are they?

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:19.720
Just what do you think you're doing there?!

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:22.270
Talk about noisy.

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:23.770
What's this thing?

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:28.150
A hedgehog? 
- Too big.

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:31.320
Of all darn things to throw it out in a place like this.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:35.740
Hey there! Good boy, come here.

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:37.030
Won't it bite?

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:40.080
No sweat. I have three cats at home.

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:40.950
Come on...

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:46.330
See he has a cheeky look.

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:48.750
Hey, you'd better listen or...

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:49.750
Hey!

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:52.260
Why you.

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:56.550
Hey, hey. Police officers aren't supposed to threaten animals.

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:57.430
But...

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:58.640
Block off your side!

00:08:58.640 --> 00:08:59.350
Yes, sir!

00:08:59.850 --> 00:09:03.180
When I signal, we'll all grab him. Got it?

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:06.190
I'll close in quietly…

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:07.480
Now!!

00:09:08.980 --> 00:09:10.480
Hey, I got his leg!

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:12.030
I got his arm!

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:15.030
All right, pull him out at the count of three!

00:09:15.450 --> 00:09:16.780
One Two Three!

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:23.790
You idiot! That's my leg... Let go of me.

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.960
Boss! I got him!

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:29.750
Get him!

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:35.050
What?

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:42.140
Reporting an emergency!

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:43.720
Reporting an emergency!

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:47.020
A gigantic blue hedgehog is going wild in town!

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:50.980
Please close off all the roads and don't let any cars onto the highways!

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:58.200
Is there such a thing as a blue hedgehog?

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:06.120
If I ever catch it, I'll sell it and make millions! I'll bet it's just some suped up car.

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:09.960
I see. That's why it's been given such a fancy name like hedgehog.

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:16.760
I've been blown somewhere...

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:18.840
There's no doubt about that...

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:26.560
At what speed are we going now?

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:28.810
120 kilometers an hour...

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:29.980
I see…

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:35.320
What? Even a police car can't catch up to it?

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:37.570
Isn't it running on the road?

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:38.650
Is that it?!

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:44.700
We've found the target!

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:49.620
It is headed up north along Central Street and is going into Highway 101!

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:50.750
Roger!

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:54.880
Patrol 85, the target is headed your way.

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:56.800
Are you ready?

00:10:57.130 --> 00:10:58.470
We're in position!

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:02.430
To get through this, you'd either have to dig through the ground or fly!

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:16.820
Or you could try a 100 meter jump.

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:23.910
Ah chopper no. 3 here, this is chopper no. 3.

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:29.200
We've been pursuing the target full speed, but it will soon, rather, has already...

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:31.080
Don't tell me?! You lost him?!

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:32.370
Bull's eye!

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:33.920
Leader!

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:36.630
This is great.

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:40.050
It's been a while since we've had some excitement.

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:42.550
S Team, let's go!!

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:11.620
What's the temperature of the road surface tonight?

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:15.330
The highway is 15 degrees. It's completely dry!

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:16.790
How about the wind from the west?

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:18.090
No wind today!

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:19.920
No sand either, I hope.

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:20.710
No, sir!

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:25.680
OK! Give me the five groove medium soft!

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:26.640
Yes, sir!

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:40.730
Okay! Everybody to your vehicles!

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:56.830
I've set 5 and 6 speed to freeway speed.

00:12:57.460 --> 00:13:01.840
Oh and about that milk. I put something special in it without telling the higher ups.

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:02.800
Thank you!

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:18.520
Chief, I lost track of the hedgehog by post 58, north of highway 101.

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:20.730
Okay, I got you.

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:23.690
You heard him. Let's go!

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:40.840
Go!

00:14:02.770 --> 00:14:04.780
The night sky looks the same....

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:07.700
So do the stars and the moon.

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:32.680
Could this be the power of the Chaos Emerald?

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:35.600
Am I in a different place?

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:38.730
Did I travel through time and space?

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:42.940
Am I the only one here?

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:45.900
Or is everyone else also here?

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:49.740
Oh well, I guess I'll soon find out!

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.560
Hi there, blue hedgehog!

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:18.980
Thanks for causing all this commotion.

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:20.100
Hey, hold it!

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:23.980
Listen till I'm finished talking, will you.

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:29.320
This town is so peaceful that we weren't getting enough stimulation.

00:15:30.740 --> 00:15:33.820
The only arrest we had this whole year was just one person...

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:39.200
The idiot brought his formula racer here and acted out being a race driver.

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:44.080
I was thinking of having some fun with him, but it was only about 2 minutes or so...

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:47.050
...that the guy managed to run around.

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:50.170
A mere 2 minutes is not even enough time to make instant ramen.

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:53.510
Hey, you're supposed to laugh!

00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:58.850
Close enough.

00:15:59.770 --> 00:16:03.190
Well, this town became a boring town as it is now...

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:06.360
mainly because of us, the special highway high speed squad, the S Team!

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:09.650
I am the leader.

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:12.860
They call me Highway Star!

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:16.030
It turned out to be a long introduction.

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:18.330
From now on, it's going to be fast!

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:31.970
Please keep it up... until I catch up with you.

00:16:50.440 --> 00:16:53.740
So they want to play chase with me? Sure sounds like fun.

00:16:54.950 --> 00:17:00.990
The hedgehog's accelerated speed! Boost up rear wing to 20 degrees! 1.7 kilometers. I'll align!

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:16.930
You're better than the ones before.

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:22.600
I'll be crushed!

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:23.810
Yeah, right!

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:26.690
He vanished?! Did I run over him?

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:28.360
What the...?!

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:32.980
Hey! Stop playing around! It's dangerous!

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:35.110
Are you going to take responsibility if kids decide to copy you!

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:39.620
You guys, don't ever get on top of a moving car, okay?

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:45.250
How dare you make light of the S Team! I'll teach you a lesson!

00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:48.960
Let's go everybody! Full boost. All wing 0.5 degrees!

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:50.710
Roger!

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:08.600
Full throttle!

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:13.820
What the?!

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:16.070
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:18.570
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:18:18.820 --> 00:18:21.280
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:21.240
This can't be happening.

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:25.160
He's playing with us. What is he anyway?

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:27.500
Chief! Please do something!

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:29.460
How frustrating!

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:33.000
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:33.000
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:33.170
