Sonic boom?!

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:29.620
The shock wave that results

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:29.620
when a jet plane or such

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:29.620
surpasses the speed of sound

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:32.150
This is on the ground...

00:19:32.190 --> 00:19:33.770
Chief!! Point D!

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:37.030
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:39.280
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:42.200
