00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:05.430
It's quite beautiful.

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:09.600
There was an amusing guy too.

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:13.020
I guess I'll have quite a lot to amuse myself with.

00:20:28.240 --> 00:20:29.080
A pool!

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:32.290
Water.

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:36.630
It's impossible.

00:22:11.140 --> 00:22:13.560
Are you all right?

00:22:15.100 --> 00:22:16.850
Yeah, thank you!

00:22:20.980 --> 00:22:23.110
You can talk?

00:22:24.110 --> 00:22:25.650
Naturally, why not?

00:22:26.530 --> 00:22:29.740
Wow, you're really talking.

00:22:30.070 --> 00:22:33.240
I'm Chris! And you are?

00:22:34.080 --> 00:22:35.750
What's your name?!

00:22:36.700 --> 00:22:37.790
I'm Sonic.

00:22:40.830 --> 00:22:42.750
Sonic the Hedgehog!

00:22:44.900 --> 00:22:48.720
<b>Tabidatsu junbi wa dekita kai?</b>

00:22:44.900 --> 00:22:48.720
<i>Are you ready to go on a journey?</i>

00:22:48.720 --> 00:22:51.990
<b>mata hitotsu asa ga kuru</b>

00:22:48.720 --> 00:22:51.990
